{room, key=assassins_room, name=Stranger's Room
    {attrib, output=false, tags=tested }

    {attrib, tags=navigation
        output={@
South, Go back into the hall.
        }
    }

    {enter_message
        output={@

You enter a stranger's room...
There is a desk set in front of a circular window.
A wide curving computer screen sits on top of the desk. Glowing source code is
spread over its surface.

Set against the wall to your right (east) is a bed.

Sitting on the bed is an open suitcase. It is filled with chips and a sleek
chrome finished lazer gun. The chips and gun are strapped in place by glowing
bands of light.
        }

        {logic, name=Assassin's room, tags=!_test
            logic={@
                ?[self]((tested)) = 'true'
            }
        }
    }

    {look
        {message
            output={@

You look around the stranger's room...
There is a desk set in front of a circular window.
A computer monitor is on the desk.

Set against the wall to your right (east) is a bed.

Sitting on the bed is an open suitcase. It is filled with chips and a sleek
chrome finished lazer gun.
            }
        }
    }

    {x_desk
        {message
            output={@
You examine the desk.
There is nothing on it except for the computer.
            }
        }
    }

    {x_monitor
        {message
            output={@
<?[player]((knows_about_killing)) = 'false'?>
Source code fills the monitor.
You scan through it. The code is very low level, but it is immediately clear -
this is an application that kills a Shellspace resident... in meat space.
It hijacks the communication channels to deliver a fatal jolt of electrical
current to the jacked in user.

You are aghast.
<else>
The code that fills the screen is compiled machine language. You attempt to
suss out what it is built to do, but successfully doing so will take you
days, perhaps weeks.
</?>
            }
        }

        {set, logic=[player]((knows_about_killing)), output=true }
    }

    {take_gun
        {message
            output={@
You attempt to take the lazer gun from the suitcase. It doesn't budge.
Apparently the glowing band is holding it in place.
            }
        }
    }

    {take_chip
        {message
            output={@
You attempt to take one of the chips from the suitcase. They don't budge.
Apparently the glowing band is holding them in place.
            }
        }
    }

    {x_bed
        {message
            output={@
You look at the bed. It is neatly made up. You don't see anything odd
about it.
            }
        }
    }


    {inject, logic=/nav.inj }
    {inject, logic=/look.inj }


    {input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((go_south))
        {move, logic=cruise_lower_02, tags=[player]
            output={@
You exit the stranger's room.
            }
        }
    }


    {input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((x_desk))
        {act, logic=x_desk, tags=!_type|room }
    }

    {input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((x_computer))
        {act, logic=x_monitor, tags=!_type|room }
    }

    {input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((x_bed))
        {act, logic=x_bed, tags=!_type|room }
    }

    {input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((gun_take))
        {act, logic=take_gun, tags=!_type|room }
    }

    {input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((chips_take))
        {act, logic=take_chip, tags=!_type|room }
    }
    {input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((chip_take))
        {act, logic=take_chip, tags=!_type|room }
    }
}
